Copyright (c) 2026 GATE Platform / Licensor. All Rights Reserved.

1. GRANT OF LICENSE
Subject to payment of applicable license/implementation fees and execution of a
written Order Form or Pilot Agreement, Licensor grants Customer (a licensed
customs brokerage) a non-exclusive, non-transferable, non-sublicensable license
to deploy and operate one (1) dedicated instance of the Software solely for
Customer's internal customs brokerage operations.

2. RESTRICTIONS
Customer shall NOT:
  (a) sell, lease, sublicense, redistribute, host as a multi-broker SaaS, or
      otherwise transfer copies of the Software or container images to any
      third party;
  (b) remove or alter proprietary notices; or
  (c) use the Software to transmit live regulatory filings without Customer's
      independent licensed customs broker review and "reasonable care"
      verification under 19 U.S.C. § 1641 and 19 CFR Part 111.

3. COMPLIANCE DISCLAIMER
All extracted trade fields, advisory HTS duty calculations, PGA flags, CBP Form
7501/3461 drafts, and CargoWise XML exports are decision-support work products
subject to verification by a licensed customs broker prior to CBP submission.
